VisWiz is a WordPress plugin for building real-time WooCommerce dashboards and reusable data visualizations.

It provides a dedicated Visualization custom post type for building progress bars, pie charts, bar/column/line/area/scatter-style charts, counters, timelines, maps, diagrams, flow diagrams, org charts, and graph-style relationships. Visualizations can be driven by live WooCommerce sales data, visualization-specific manual data, or reusable datasets stored in custom database tables.

Key features include:
- Real-time WooCommerce sales progress and breakdowns with configurable date ranges.
- A Visualization CPT with an editing interface for type selection, data entry, legend/label/theme settings, preview, and shortcode embedding.
- Custom tables for visualization containers, reusable datasets, data points, and graph/flow/org-chart relationships.
- Relationship attributes for graph-like visualizations including direction, intensity, and relation type.
- Saved visualization library with copy-ready shortcodes and a Gutenberg block selector.
